<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>mapx Blog – Search</title><link>https://blog.mapx.at/tags/search/</link><description>Recent content in Search on mapx Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>de</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 04:00:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mapx.at/tags/search/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Road-kilometre search, park and ride, level crossings</title><link>https://blog.mapx.at/strassenkilometer-suche-und-pr-ebene-en/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 04:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mapx.at/strassenkilometer-suche-und-pr-ebene-en/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Road maintenance, traffic reports and accident notes name places as &amp;ldquo;A1 km 41&amp;rdquo;. Search understands that now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="search-a-road-kilometre"&gt;Search a road kilometre&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="search-a-road-kilometre"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#search-a-road-kilometre" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink für diesen Abschnitt"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -s -G &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://api.mapx.at/v1/geocode&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --data-urlencode &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;q=A1 km 41&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --data-urlencode &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;types=road_ref&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; jq &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.features[0] | {coordinates: .geometry.coordinates, road_ref: .properties.road_ref}&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Code kopieren"
aria-label="Code kopieren"
data-copied-label="Kopiert!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Response on 8 Nov 2026:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;coordinates&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;15.845576&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;48.174449&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;road_ref&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;ref&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;A1&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;km&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mf"&gt;41.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Code kopieren"
aria-label="Code kopieren"
data-copied-label="Kopiert!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;B83 km 329,7&lt;/code&gt; (comma as decimal separator) and &lt;code&gt;L190 km 3.5&lt;/code&gt; work as well. Per the docs there is a point every 0.1 km on motorways, expressways and federal roads and every 0.5 km on state roads; the nearest one is returned (source: GIP.at). For &lt;code&gt;B83 km 329,7&lt;/code&gt; the result on 8 Nov 2026 was a point in Carinthia (14.0286 / 46.6103).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="park-and-ride-bike-and-ride-level-crossings"&gt;Park and ride, bike and ride, level crossings&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="park-and-ride-bike-and-ride-level-crossings"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#park-and-ride-bike-and-ride-level-crossings" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink für diesen Abschnitt"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The layer group &lt;code&gt;gip_poi&lt;/code&gt; in the &lt;code&gt;streets&lt;/code&gt; style shows, among others, park-and-ride sites, bike-and-ride sites and level crossings (&lt;code&gt;kind&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;code&gt;park_and_ride&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;park_and_ride_garage&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;bike_and_ride&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;level_crossing&lt;/code&gt;). Tilequery tells you what is nearby:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -s &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://api.mapx.at/v1/tilequery/gip-poi/15.3294,48.2272.json?radius=600&amp;amp;limit=10&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; jq &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.features[] | {kind: .properties.kind, name: .properties.name, distance: .properties.tilequery.distance}&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Code kopieren"
aria-label="Code kopieren"
data-copied-label="Kopiert!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Around Melk on 8 Nov 2026 this returned a bike-and-ride site &amp;ldquo;Melk&amp;rdquo; at 310 m and a park-and-ride site &amp;ldquo;Melk&amp;rdquo; at 355 m. The layer is available from zoom 12.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More: &lt;a href="https://docs.mapx.at/api/geocoding/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Geocoding API&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://docs.mapx.at/api/tilequery/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Tilequery&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>